ow exactly what to expect. \u55357 \u56382 ","publishedDate":"2026-08-03T18:37:49.000Z","updatedDate":null\},"consumersReviewCountOnSameDomain":1,"consumersReviewCountOnSameLocation":null,"productReviews":[],"language":"en","location":null\},\{"id":"6a6a7de07d111daa931697c9","filtered":false,"isPending":false,"text":"Filing a claim with Fetch was very easy, and processing took less than two weeks! Everything was easy to understand. They communicated at every step of the process. I\'92m very pleased with their service and speed.","rating":5,"labels":\{"merged":null,"verification":\{"isVerified":true,"createdDateTime":"2026-07-30T00:25:36.000Z","reviewSourceName":"InvitationLinkApi","verificationSource":"invitation","verificationLevel":"invited","hasDachExclusion":false\}\},"title":"Claim handled easily and quickly ","likes":0,"source":"InvitationLinkApi","dates":\{"experiencedDate":"2026-07-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedDate":"2026-07-30T00:25:36.000Z","updatedDate":null,"submittedDate":null\},"report":null,"hasUnhandledReports":false,"consumer":\{"id":"6a6a7ddfff3db26aa4c9be24","displayName":"Shannon","imageUrl":"","numberOfReviews":1,"countryCode":"US","hasImage":false,"isVerified":false\},"reply":\{"message":"Thank you, Shannon! \u55357 \u56382 ","publishedDate":"2026-07-30T14:47:31.000Z","updatedDate":null\},"consumersReviewCountOnSameDomain":1,"consumersReviewCountOnSameLocation":null,"productReviews":[],"language":"en","location":null\},\{"id":"6a69ddf14208cd2f8930259c","filtered":false,"isPending":false,"text":"I\'92ve had my English bulldog covered by fetch since he was 8 weeks old and Fetch always came through until he aged and developed all the things that bulldogs typically experience which is why I got insurance when he was a puppy. However, once we were placing claims monthly upon renewal the price TRIPLED right when we needed it most. After paying premiums and NOT using the insurance regularly for 8 years NOW they want to triple the cost knowing that another company won\'92t cover him reasonably priced due to preexisting conditions. Better off putting monthly stipends away for rainy days!","rating":3,"labels":\{"merged":null,"verification":\{"isVerified":false,"createdDateTime":"2026-07-29T13:03:13.000Z","reviewSourceName":"Organic","verificationSource":"invitation","verificationLevel":"not-verified","hasDachExclusion":false\}\},"title":"Shady","likes":0,"source":"Organic","dates":\{"experiencedDate":"2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedDate":"2026-07-29T13:03:13.000Z","updatedDate":null,"submittedDate":null\},"report":null,"hasUnhandledReports":false,"consumer":\{"id":"6a69dde8ff3db2a74bc8ac97","displayName":"Lisa DeArment","imageUrl":"https://user-images.trustpilot.com/6a69dde8ff3db2a74bc8ac97/73x73.png","numberOfReviews":1,"countryCode":"US","hasImage":true,"isVerified":false\},"reply":\{"message":"Hi Lisa, tank you for sharing your experience with us, and for trusting Fetch with your English bulldog\'92s care over the past eight years. We appreciate the time you spent with us, and we completely understand your frustration regarding premium increases\'97especially during your pup's senior years when care becomes most vital. When policies come up for annual renewal, rates are calculated using key factors such as your pet's age, breed, and overall claim history. The years of minimal claims were reflected in your lower baseline rates during his younger years. However, as pets age and health needs naturally increase, rates are adjusted to keep up with the rising cost of veterinary care. We see that you\'92ve made the decision to cancel your coverage, and while were sad to part ways, we completely respect your choice. We wish you and your sweet bulldog all the very best, and if you ever need anything or have questions in the future, our team is always here for you at 866.467.3875.","publishedDate":"2026-07-29T22:02:00.000Z","updatedDate":null\},"consumersReviewCountOnSameDomain":1,"consumersReviewCountOnSameLocation":null,"productReviews":[],"language":"en","location":null\},\{"id":"6a679afa29d9a50558ec27b9","filtered":false,"isPending":false,"text":"I had a wonderful customer service experience with Fetch Pet Insurance today, thanks to Nadine.\\n\\nI needed to enroll 13 dogs, and because of some system issues, each policy required careful individual attention and adjustment. Nadine was incredibly kind, patient, thoughtful, and professional throughout the entire process. She took the time to help me work through every issue one by one and made what could have been a very stressful process feel smooth and manageable.\\n\\nThank you, Nadine, for your excellent service and genuine care. I really appreciate all your help.","rating":5,"labels":\{"merged":null,"verification":\{"isVerified":false,"createdDateTime":"2026-07-27T19:52:58.000Z","reviewSourceName":"Organic","verificationSource":"invitation","verificationLevel":"not-verified","hasDachExclusion":false\}\},"title":"I had a wonderful customer service\'85","likes":0,"source":"Organic","dates":\{"experiencedDate":"2026-07-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedDate":"2026-07-27T19:52:58.000Z","updatedDate":null,"submittedDate":null\},"report":null,"hasUnhandledReports":false,"consumer":\{"id":"6a679aa3236e3d5a51e70b48","displayName":"Peter","imageUrl":"","numberOfReviews":1,"countryCode":"CA","hasImage":false,"isVerified":false\},"reply":\{"message":"That is extraordinary. We'll make sure she sees this, Peter. Thank you! \u55357 \u56382 ","publishedDate":"2026-07-28T15:50:29.000Z","updatedDate":null\},"consumersReviewCountOnSameDomain":1,"consumersReviewCountOnSameLocation":null,"productReviews":[],"language":"en","location":null\},\{"id":"6a679acea609783dff426e4f","filtered":false,"isPending":false,"text":"I've been in the vet world for over 25 years and then the Animal related business as adog trainer for the last 23 years. I have Trupanion on one dog because My Dog has a pre-existing condition.  I have the rest of my animals with Fetch. 