","locale":"en-US"\},\{"languageCode":"es","isoLanguage":"es","uri":"https://es.trustpilot.com","locale":"es-ES"\}],"domain":"https://www.trustpilot.com"\},"aiSummary":\{"summary":"Looking at 2,366 reviews, reviewers overwhelmingly had a great experience with this company. Customers consistently praise the staff for their helpfulness, knowledge, and patience, often highlighting specific agents who provided excellent support and made interactions easy. People appreciate the personalized approach from customer service, noting quick connections to knowledgeable representatives. The claims process is frequently described as quick, efficient, and easy to navigate, leading many long-term customers to consistently return.\\n\\nHowever, some customers found the claims process confusing or difficult, particularly when uploading documents. A few also reported challenges connecting with a human agent, and some experienced issues with claims being denied or receiving low reimbursement, questioning the coverage.","modelVersion":"2.3.0"\},"topicAiSummaries":[\{"id":"60a6634c961d18000147bf78_en_staff","topic":"staff","summary":"Users describe positive interactions with staff, frequently highlighting their helpfulness, knowledge, and kindness. Many reviewers praised specific agents for their excellent service, patience, and ability to answer questions thoroughly. Customers appreciated staff members who listened to their concerns, provided clear explanations, and offered suitable options without pressure. Overall, consumers found the personnel to be professional, efficient, and a pleasure to work with."\},\{"id":"60a6634c961d18000147bf78_en_customer_service","topic":"customer_service","summary":"Reviewers highlight positive aspects of customer service, with many praising the helpfulness, knowledge, and patience of agents. Customers consistently report that representatives took the time to answer questions thoroughly, explain coverage, and assist with various issues, making the process smooth and manageable. Many appreciated the clear communication, quick connections to knowledgeable reps, and the overall excellent service, with some noting they have been long-term customers due to these positive experiences. However, a few reviewers expressed dissatisfaction with automated calls and chat bots, and difficulty connecting with a human agent, especially for claim results."\},\{"id":"60a6634c961d18000147bf78_en_claim","topic":"claim","summary":"Customers had positive experiences with claim, noting that filing a claim was very easy and the processing was quick, often taking less than two weeks. Many reviewers appreciated the fast claim approval and reimbursement timing, with some claims processed within 24 to 48 hours or even days. However, some customers expressed disappointment with the amount reimbursed, while others faced denied claims due to issues like pre-existing conditions or unexpected rate increases."\},\{"id":"60a6634c961d18000147bf78_en_service","topic":"service","summary":"Consumers generally report positive experiences with the service, highlighting excellent customer service, speed, and efficiency. Many reviewers appreciate the knowledgeable and professional staff who provide genuine care and clear explanations of policies and coverage. Customers are satisfied that the company lives up to its promises and provides peace of mind during emergencies, with some noting quick processing times and easy claim processes. However, some express frustration with unexpected cost increases and reduced coverage, especially for pets with pre-existing conditions."\},\{"id":"60a6634c961d18000147bf78_en_user_experience","topic":"user_experience","summary":"Customers consistently note positive experiences with user experience, praising the ease of understanding and the straightforward, user-friendly app and website for tasks like uploading documents and submitting claims. Reviewers appreciate the quick reimbursement process and the helpful, patient customer service that makes complex situations feel manageable. However, some consumers, particularly seniors, found certain aspects challenging, such as navigating the site, uploading paperwork, or dealing with a confusing claim submission process and a useless chatbot."\}],"prePackedAnswers":null,"prePackedAnswersReviews":null,"topicSummaryLocalizedTopics":[\{"id":"staff","displayName":"Staff"\},\{"id":"customer_service","displayName":"Customer service"\},\{"id":"claim","displayName":"Claim"\},\{"id":"service","displayName":"Service"\},\{"id":"user_experience","displayName":"User experience"\}],"showAdvertisement":false,"showProductReviews":true,"showPrePackedAnswers":false,"similarBusinessUnits":[\{"businessUnitId":"5550bbfb0000ff00057f57f8","businessUnitDisplayName":"Trupanion","businessUnitIdentifyingName":"trupanion.com","businessUnitLogo":"//s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/tpd/logos/5550bbfb0000ff00057f57f8/0x0.png","numberOfReviews":11955,"stars":4.5,"statusCode":1,"tier":"5dd5135ce747052198a08e6b","trustScore":4.4,"consumerAlert":null\},\{"businessUnitId":"62e828a015be0d5057f853c0","businessUnitDisplayName":"Spot Pet Insurance","businessUnitIdentifyingName":"spotpet.com","businessUnitLogo":"//s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/tpd/logos/62e828a015be0d5057f853c0/0x0.png","numberOfReviews":11664,"stars":4.5,"statusCode":1,"tier":"5dd5135ce747052198a08e6b","trustScore":4.6,"consumerAlert":null\},\{"businessUnitId":"5f0d859849fc9a0001b244cf","businessUnitDisplayName":"Pumpkin Pet Insurance","businessUnitIdentifyingName":"www.pumpkin.care","businessUnitLogo":"//s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/tpd/logos/5f0d859849fc9a0001b244cf/0x0.png","numberOfReviews":3604,"stars":5,"statusCode":1,"tier":"5dd5135ce747052198a08e6b","trustScore":4.8,"consumerAlert":null\},\{"businessUnitId":"5627b9f40000ff0005849b12","businessUnitDisplayName":"Pets Best Pet Health Insurance","businessUnitIdentifyingName":"petsbest.com","businessUnitLogo":"//s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/tpd/screenshotlogo-domain/5627b9f