ity":"New York","country":"United States"\},"guarantee":\{"display":false,"header":null,"teaser":null,"html":null,"image":null\},"businessUnitCountry":"US","categories":[\{"id":"pet_insurance_company","breadcrumb":\{"name":"pet_insurance_company","localizedName":"Pet Insurance Company"\},"isPrimary":true,"ranking":\{"position":6,"cardinality":17\},"hasRanking":true,"isBadCategory":false\}],"descriptionText":"As the most complete pet insurance provider in the United States and Canada, Fetch helps pet parents prepare for the unexpected. From everyday illnesses to sudden emergencies, Fetch covers up to 90% of unexpected vet bills,  including treatment for every adult tooth and the cost of emergency exams.\\n\\nWith the Fetch Pet Insurance App, caring for your pet just got easier. Available to download on the Google Play Store and Apple\'92s App Store, pet parents can use the app to quickly submit and track claims, manage billing and access 24/7 customer support. The app also connects members to our online pharmacy, Fetch Pet Rx, where qualifying prescriptions are eligible for 100% reimbursement.\\n\\nThe Fetch Veterinary Advisory Board, a team of trusted veterinarians and industry experts, helps ensure that our products and partnerships meet the highest standards in pet health and wellness. Members also get access to Fetch Health Perks, a curated marketplace offering more than $1,500 in discounts from brands that share our commitment to pets and their people.\\n\\nAt Fetch, compassion goes beyond coverage. We\'92ve given millions to no-kill shelters across North America and teamed up with Project Street Vet to provide free veterinary care for the pets of people experiencing homelessness. Our 300+ team members (most proud pet parents themselves) share one goal: helping every pet live a longer, healthier life.\\n","descriptionTextPlain":"As the most complete pet insurance provider in the United States and Canada, Fetch helps pet parents prepare for the unexpected. From everyday illnesses to sudden emergencies, Fetch covers up to 90% of unexpected vet bills,  including treatment for every adult tooth and the cost of emergency exams.With the Fetch Pet Insurance App, caring for your pet just got easier. Available to download on the Google Play Store and Apple\'92s App Store, pet parents can use the app to quickly submit and track claims, manage billing and access 24/7 customer support. The app also connects members to our online pharmacy, Fetch Pet Rx, where qualifying prescriptions are eligible for 100% reimbursement.The Fetch Veterinary Advisory Board, a team of trusted veterinarians and industry experts, helps ensure that our products and partnerships meet the highest standards in pet health and wellness. Members also get access to Fetch Health Perks, a curated marketplace offering more than $1,500 in discounts from brands that share our commitment to pets and their people.At Fetch, compassion goes beyond coverage. We\'92ve given millions to no-kill shelters across North America and teamed up with Project Street Vet to provide free veterinary care for the pets of people experiencing homelessness. Our 300+ team members (most proud pet parents themselves) share one goal: helping every pet live a longer, healthier life.","informationSource":"customer"\},"locationsBox":\{"topLocations":[]\},"similarBusinessUnitsBox":\{"businessUnitTier":"5dd5135ce747052198a08e6b","activelyInvitingStatusCode":2\}\},"newrelicBrowserTimingHeader":"window.NREUM||(NREUM=\{\});NREUM.info = \{\\"agent\\":\\"\\",\\"beacon\\":\\"bam.eu01.nr-data.net\\",\\"errorBeacon\\":\\"bam.eu01.nr-data.net\\",\\"licenseKey\\":\\"NRBR-ab2d2379f7d606ec0e0\\",\\"applicationID\\":\\"462890258\\",\\"agentToken\\":null,\\"applicationTime\\":154.122307,\\"transactionName\\":\\"MhBSZQoZXkZXAUQNDgtaZ1QaPkJUWwdHCxMOIEJYVzZVTUIIQ0smICEfHgodRlxTFR8/AxAGWV8dC0NgWAtEOQ==\\",\\"queueTime\\":0,\\"ttGuid\\":\\"fe694516a93e5496\\"\}; (window.NREUM||(NREUM=\{\})).init=\{privacy:\{cookies_enab